Web-MIDI-Player C DSP

Audio algorithms adapted from SpessaSynth core 4.3.22 by spessasus and
contributors, licensed under Apache License 2.0. The local changes translate
the sample, envelope, filter and effects loops to portable C and add scalar
and SIMD128 WebAssembly builds and native tests.

Upstream: https://github.com/spessasus/spessasynth_core
License: ../licenses/SpessaSynth-Apache-2.0.txt

The Dattorro reverb algorithm was originally implemented by khoin and released
into the public domain, then adapted for SpessaSynth by spessasus.
Original source: https://github.com/khoin/DattorroReverbNode/
